          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading": "Standards",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "accordion_text": "<p><strong>Our Commitment to Quality</strong></p><ul><li>100% Nature-Identical</li><li>No Harsh Synthetics</li><li>No Fillers, Only Actives</li><li>Clinically & Scientifically Proven</li><li>Dermatologist Tested</li><li>Certified Safe for Sensitive Skin</li><li>Non-Toxic (Toxicologist Audited)</li><li>Third-Party Safety & Stability Tested<br/></li></ul><p><strong>Clean & Ethical Practices</strong></p><ul><li>Ultra-Clean Ingredients</li><li>Free from Artificial Fragrances & Dyes</li><li>Traceable, Ethical, Premium Ingredients</li><li>Non-GMO Verified Ingredients</li><li>Sustainably Sourced & Verified</li><li>Cruelty-Free & Vegan Certified</li><li>European Union Certified<br/></li></ul><p><strong>Sustainability at Heart</strong></p><ul><li>Plastic Neutral Certified</li><li>Carbon Neutral Certified</li><li>Zero-Waste Refills</li><li>Ocean-Friendly</li><li>1% for the Planet Member</li><li>Reusable & Biodegradable Packaging<br/></li></ul><p><strong>Crafted with Care</strong></p><ul><li>Artisan Small Batches</li><li>In-House Lab Made</li><li>Herbalist-Chemist Formulated</li><li>Good Manufacturing Practices Certified<br/></li></ul><p><strong>Proudly Independent</strong></p><ul><li>Small Family Business</li><li>Woman-Owned</li><li>Independently Operated, Never Outsourced</li></ul>",
